Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, python3-nautilus, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtksource-5, gnome-shell (>= 50), gnome-shell (<< 51), libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: git, gnome-shell-extension-prefs
Description: context-aware Markdown editor in a GNOME Wayland side drawer
 cument places a native Markdown editor at the right edge of your desktop.
 A global shortcut and a vertical project tab reveal a directory-clustered
 map of notes. Bash, Zsh, Fish and GNOME Files integration follow your working context.
 Includes autosave, conflict detection, Markdown highlighting and GNOME
 appearance integration. Enable the included Shell extension after install.
